Server init.
>> a := Blob crear: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista crear ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob crear: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista crear ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a crear.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Salida escribir: ( a ^ c ), detener. } capturar: { :e Salida escribir: e, detener. }, empezar.
a liberar.
b liberar.
